          "@type": "Annotation"
        }
      ],
      "description": "A version string. On a score it is the CVSS version; on a product entry, the product's.",
      "comments": [
        "Each class that uses it narrows it. A top-level slot, so that lokf adapt renames it beside LOKF's version."
      ],
      "from_schema": "https://w3id.org/lmodel/cve/cve_cvss",
